    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf34 <strong>Glide into Adventure with Lou\u2019s Lagoon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Uncle Lou has mysteriously vanished, leaving you in charge of his seaplane delivery service. Now, it\u2019s up to you to keep the business thriving, connect the islands, and uncover the mystery of his disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/1cec8628fa7bb37c187b405e370ad97c.poster.avif?t=1754561448\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/1cec8628fa7bb37c187b405e370ad97c.webm?t=1754561448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/1cec8628fa7bb37c187b405e370ad97c.mp4?t=1754561448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With your trusty vacuum \u2013 the Swirler 2000 \u2013 by your side, explore the vibrant Limbo Archipelago. Harvest resources, craft items, and deliver them to customers across a land full of secrets and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your seaplane isn\u2019t just for getting around \u2013 you can upgrade and customize it to your liking as you go. Take on challenges like ring courses and races, or relax and enjoy the beautiful landscapes as you fly. Make sure to keep your eyes open for hidden treasures and secrets that may lead you to Uncle Lou\u2019s whereabouts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/4eea74e5bfcf3a73eb9fce3c92ebcea6.poster.avif?t=1754561448\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/4eea74e5bfcf3a73eb9fce3c92ebcea6.webm?t=1754561448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/4eea74e5bfcf3a73eb9fce3c92ebcea6.mp4?t=1754561448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2708\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0e <strong>A World Full of Wonder</strong>: Explore multiple islands, each with its own atmosphere, residents, and hidden treasures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Seaplane Delivery</strong>: Grow your business by connecting the islands and helping the locals.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f <strong>Take to the Skies</strong>: Fly from island to island and test your skills in different races and challenges!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Build &amp; Decorate</strong>: Create your perfect home and add your personal flair to the island.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf9 <strong>Swirler 2000</strong>: Harvest resources and unlock upgrades with your trusty multi-purpose vacuum.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Full Character Customization</strong>: Make your avatar uniquely yours, from hairstyle to accessories!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee9\ufe0f <strong>Customizable Seaplane</strong>: Upgrade your plane to suit your needs, and customize it to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/149118575a7f3b4ec83ee42b0c737176.poster.avif?t=1754561448\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/149118575a7f3b4ec83ee42b0c737176.webm?t=1754561448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/149118575a7f3b4ec83ee42b0c737176.mp4?t=1754561448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re hot on the trail to solving the mystery of Uncle Lou or just kicking back and enjoying island life, <strong>Lou\u2019s Lagoon</strong> is your ticket to an exciting adventure. Ready to take off? \u2708\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Thanks to our partners:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/4b99b1fc03ee98643c3d9353974dca8d.avif?t=1754561448\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf34 <strong>Glide into Adventure with Lou\u2019s Lagoon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Uncle Lou has mysteriously vanished, leaving you in charge of his seaplane delivery service. Now, it\u2019s up to you to keep the business thriving, connect the islands, and uncover the mystery of his disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/1cec8628fa7bb37c187b405e370ad97c.poster.avif?t=1754561448\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/1cec8628fa7bb37c187b405e370ad97c.webm?t=1754561448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/1cec8628fa7bb37c187b405e370ad97c.mp4?t=1754561448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With your trusty vacuum \u2013 the Swirler 2000 \u2013 by your side, explore the vibrant Limbo Archipelago. Harvest resources, craft items, and deliver them to customers across a land full of secrets and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your seaplane isn\u2019t just for getting around \u2013 you can upgrade and customize it to your liking as you go. Take on challenges like ring courses and races, or relax and enjoy the beautiful landscapes as you fly. Make sure to keep your eyes open for hidden treasures and secrets that may lead you to Uncle Lou\u2019s whereabouts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/4eea74e5bfcf3a73eb9fce3c92ebcea6.poster.avif?t=1754561448\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/4eea74e5bfcf3a73eb9fce3c92ebcea6.webm?t=1754561448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/4eea74e5bfcf3a73eb9fce3c92ebcea6.mp4?t=1754561448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2708\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0e <strong>A World Full of Wonder</strong>: Explore multiple islands, each with its own atmosphere, residents, and hidden treasures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Seaplane Delivery</strong>: Grow your business by connecting the islands and helping the locals.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f <strong>Take to the Skies</strong>: Fly from island to island and test your skills in different races and challenges!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Build &amp; Decorate</strong>: Create your perfect home and add your personal flair to the island.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf9 <strong>Swirler 2000</strong>: Harvest resources and unlock upgrades with your trusty multi-purpose vacuum.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Full Character Customization</strong>: Make your avatar uniquely yours, from hairstyle to accessories!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee9\ufe0f <strong>Customizable Seaplane</strong>: Upgrade your plane to suit your needs, and customize it to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/149118575a7f3b4ec83ee42b0c737176.poster.avif?t=1754561448\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/149118575a7f3b4ec83ee42b0c737176.webm?t=1754561448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/149118575a7f3b4ec83ee42b0c737176.mp4?t=1754561448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re hot on the trail to solving the mystery of Uncle Lou or just kicking back and enjoying island life, <strong>Lou\u2019s Lagoon</strong> is your ticket to an exciting adventure. Ready to take off? \u2708\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Thanks to our partners:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/4b99b1fc03ee98643c3d9353974dca8d.avif?t=1754561448\" /></div></p>",
